// VehicleError Describes a part of the vehicle data that could not be retrieved, is not supported, or is currently disabled. `*_UNSUPPORTED` errors are only reported for parts explicitly requested via the `include` parameter; when `include` is omitted, unsupported parts are simply absent without an error.
